  "proven_metric": "All six distinct native getNetLength values equal the sum of their native LINE segment centerline lengths to <1e-4mil (2.54nm; individual native LINE endpoint serialization/rounding). This metric counts entire drawn primitives, including branch/overlapping landing copper, while excluding pad-center, via-center and same-net stroke joining distances. It is not a designated endpoint path metric.",
